      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكّف الإِكَافَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْكِيفٌ</span>, <i>He made the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكاف</span>; (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وكّفهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْكِيفٌ</span>;
which latter, accord. to IF, is the original form.
